        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Gateway & load balancing.** The first row shows what the *gateway* sees (per route); the second row proves the *load balancer* spread requests over the three product-service instances. Flip round-robin/random in the lab UI and watch the bars."
      }
